<title>GREECE: NATIONAL BANK ATMS DOWN EARLY SUNDAY NOV 10.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK ATMS DOWN EARLY SUNDAY NOV 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>State National Bank of Greece said its ATMs will be out of order for four hours on Sunday November 10 from 05:00-09:00.</p>
<p>The bank's ATM network will be serviced during these hours. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
